  "summary": "Ceremonial masks used by Yupik peoples in traditional dances and rituals, featuring complex designs and symbolic representations of spirits and animals.",
  "description": "The aesthetic combines naturalistic and abstract elements with vibrant colors and organic materials, reflecting the spiritual significance of each mask. These masks were created for specific ceremonies and dances, with designs passed down through generations while allowing for individual artistic expression.",
